  - SpeakerName: Drakmora Commander
    DialogueText: A foolish tactical blunder. They are funneling into a narrow pass.
    PortraitLeft: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitMiddle: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitRight: {fileID: 0}
    Background: {fileID: 0}
    Focus: 0
    BackgroundOverlay: 0
    EventID: 
